OL,3,GNEWSAJuly fortnight to remain but
OL,4,Aautumn break to move
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire's traditional early
OL,7,F"July fortnight" start to the summer
OL,8,Fholidays will be retained after
OL,9,Fcouncillors agreed future school term
OL,10,Fdates, although changes to October
OL,11,Fhalf-term have been approved.
OL,13,FLeicestershire County Council's cabinet
OL,14,Fmet on Tuesday to agree to set
OL,15,Fcalendars for future school years from
OL,16,Fautumn 2027 to summer 2032.
OL,18,FEarlier this year, the authority set
OL,19,Fout proposed changes to school term
OL,20,Ftimes which could have ended the
OL,21,Ftraditional early start to the summer
OL,22,Fbreak in the county.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
